  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Gyanchandra vs State Of U.P. And Another on 15 May, 2024 High Court Of Judicature At Allahabad ? Neutral Citation No. - 2024:Ahc:87519 Court No. - 92 Case :- Application U/S 482 No. - 11351 of 2024 Applicant :- Gyanchandra Opposite Party :- State of U.P. and Another Counsel for Applicant :- Brijesh Kumar Kesharwani Counsel for Opposite Party :- G.A. Hon'ble Arun Kumar Singh Deshwal,J. 1.",
    "facts": "2. The present application has been filed to quash the entire proceeding of Case No.2629 of 2019, State through Food Safety Office Vs Ghyanchandra Gupta, u/s 26/59(i) of Food Safety and Standards Act, 2006, pending in the court of Additional Chief Judicial Magistrate-1, Kanpur Dehat.",
    "arguments": "3. At the very outset, learned counsel for the applicant submits that the applicant does not want to press the prayer for quashing the impugned proceeding and want to surrender before the court below and apply for bail.",
